exports[`onboarding wizard > walks welcome → Touch ID → limits → creating → backup → done without timers > protect your wallet 1`] = `
"
  AgentPay · Protect your wallet

  Step 2 of 6  ● ● ○ ○ ○ ○  Protect your wallet

  Admin actions, like approving a large payment or changing limits, need your approval.

  ✓ Approve with Touch ID or your Mac password instead of typing sudo commands.
  ✓ The key lives in this Mac’s Secure Enclave and never leaves it.
  ✓ You can turn it off any time in Security.

  › Turn on Touch ID (recommended)
    Not now, use sudo

  ↑↓ select · enter confirm
"
`;

